# Chunk reward attribution

Canonical write-up: `cosmo_sr_project/docs/chunk_reward_attribution.md`.

## Rule

**Halo finding uses full-box (or margin-context) Rockstar. Reward credit is local
(host → 64³ by centre).** Do not train on bare periodic Lagrangian crops.

- Naive crop Rockstar (`audit_chunk_rockstar.py`) ranks HR > SR2 but absolute
  `R_occ` is misspecified (whole-box μ,C on a 25 Mpc fake universe).
- Host-level `E_cat` (`audit_host_chunk_reward.py`) uses existing full-box
  catalogs; terms are separate: miss, FP, Huber(Δlog M), Huber(ΔN_sub), W1(mass ratio).

